Add FlyDSL Muse MoE kernels missing from pinned aiter c16d44b9

Target repo: aiter
    git -C $AITER_ROOT apply patches/04-aiter-muse-moe-flydsl.patch

Required by MUSE_MOE_BACKEND=flydsl. The overlay wrapper
(sglang_meta_common/ops/muse_moe_flydsl.py) imports
aiter.ops.flydsl.muse_moe_gemm and muse_moe_finalize; those modules are not in
the clean image / aiter c16d44b9. This patch adds both files (grouped GEMM +
per-expert RMSNorm finalize). Python-only; no JIT rebuild.

Independent of Plan A/B/C attention patches. Do not stack
patches/experimental/aiter-muse-moe-flydsl-decode-pipeline.patch on top of this
file — the gemm here already includes that MXFP4 decode-pipeline retune.

